            "Check and save": [
                "Yoxlay\u0131n v\u0259 yadda saxlay\u0131n"
            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "Po\u00e7t siyah\u0131s\u0131 xidm\u0259tini bir d\u0259f\u0259 qo\u015fun; bundan sonra ist\u0259nil\u0259n forma onu dolduran \u015f\u0259xsl\u0259ri siyah\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131zdan birin\u0259 \u0259lav\u0259 ed\u0259 bil\u0259r (forma blokunun parametrl\u0259ri \u2192 G\u00f6nd\u0259rildikd\u0259n sonra). A\u00e7ar s\u00f6zl\u0259r xidm\u0259tl\u0259 yoxlan\u0131l\u0131r, bu saytda \u015fifr\u0259l\u0259nmi\u015f \u015f\u0259kild\u0259 saxlan\u0131l\u0131r v\u0259 bir daha g\u00f6st\u0259rilmir."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "Form g\u00f6nd\u0259ri\u015fl\u0259rini v\u0259 d\u00fcym\u0259 klikl\u0259rini he\u00e7 bir kod yazmadan analitikan\u0131za g\u00f6nd\u0259rin. H\u0259min xidm\u0259ti \u00f6t\u00fcr\u00fcb ke\u00e7m\u0259k \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn ID-ni bo\u015f burax\u0131n. D\u00fcym\u0259l\u0259rin \"T\u0259kmil\" panelind\u0259 \"Konversiya hadis\u0259si\" sah\u0259si olur. Kukis (cookie) paneli aktiv olduqda, ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i raz\u0131la\u015fana q\u0259d\u0259r he\u00e7 n\u0259 y\u00fckl\u0259nmir."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "Google Analytics 4 \u00f6l\u00e7m\u0259 identifikatoru"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "Google Tag Manager konteyner ID-si"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "Meta Pixel ID (Meta Hadis\u0259 Menecerind\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259ril\u0259n n\u00f6mr\u0259)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "Bu teql\u0259ri sayt\u0131ma y\u00fckl\u0259yin"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "\u018fg\u0259r teman\u0131z v\u0259 ya dig\u0259r plaqininiz bunsuz da onlar\u0131 \u0259lav\u0259 edirs\u0259, s\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcn; t\u0259dbirl\u0259r h\u0259l\u0259 d\u0259 g\u00f6nd\u0259rilir."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "Forma g\u00f6nd\u0259ri\u015fl\u0259ri \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn t\u0259dbir ad\u0131"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Banner bloklarla dizayn etdiyiniz popapd\u0131r. Onun d\u00fcym\u0259l\u0259ri #consent-accept, #consent-reject v\u0259 #consent-save (saxlamaq \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcn \"analytics\" v\u0259 \"marketing\" adlanan qutu\u00e7alar\u0131 il\u0259) ke\u00e7id edir; ist\u0259nil\u0259n yerd\u0259 #consent-open ke\u00e7idi onu yenid\u0259n g\u00f6st\u0259rir. Ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i q\u0259bul ed\u0259n\u0259 q\u0259d\u0259r izl\u0259m\u0259 teql\u0259ri y\u00fckl\u0259nmir, Google Consent Mode \"denied\" olaraq qal\u0131r v\u0259 siyah\u0131ya ald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z skriptl\u0259r s\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fclm\u00fc\u015f v\u0259ziyy\u0259td\u0259 qal\u0131r."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "Haz\u0131r banner yarad\u0131n"
            ],
            "Show a cookie banner": [
                "Kuki bannerini g\u00f6st\u0259r"
            ],
            "Banner": [
                "Banner"
            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "Pop-up se\u00e7in\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (qaralama)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Banneri redakt\u0259 et"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "Se\u00e7imi (days) m\u00fcdd\u0259tin\u0259 yadda saxla"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Avropa \u0130ttifaq\u0131, A\u0130T v\u0259 B\u00f6y\u00fck Britaniyadan k\u0259narda: ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i imtina ed\u0259n\u0259 q\u0259d\u0259r y\u00fckl\u0259nm\u0259nin izl\u0259nm\u0259si"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "S\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcl\u00fcb: h\u0259r bir ziyar\u0259t\u00e7i \u0259vv\u0259lc\u0259 raz\u0131la\u015fmal\u0131d\u0131r (\u0259n s\u0259rt qayda v\u0259 susmaya g\u00f6r\u0259 parametr). Yand\u0131r\u0131l\u0131b: yaln\u0131z hostinqiniz v\u0259 ya CDN ziyar\u0259t\u00e7inin \u00f6lk\u0259sini bildirdikd\u0259 (m\u0259s\u0259l\u0259n, Cloudflare-in CF-IPCountry ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131) v\u0259 bu \u00f6lk\u0259 EU, EEA, B\u00f6y\u00fck Britaniya v\u0259 \u0130sve\u00e7r\u0259d\u0259n k\u0259narda olduqda. Banner yen\u0259 d\u0259 g\u00f6st\u0259rilirv\u0259 nam\u0259lum \u00f6lk\u0259 EU daxilind\u0259 hesab olunur."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "Raz\u0131l\u0131q veril\u0259n\u0259d\u0259k saxlan\u0131lacaq dig\u0259r skriptl\u0259r (handle:analytics v\u0259 ya handle:marketing, verg\u00fcll\u0259 ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f)"
